  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 55 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^17 + x^27 + x^28 + x^38, b(x) = x^9 + x^24 + x^31 + x^46 in F_2[x]/(x^55 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^55 - 1)",
